{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GPRuLgC6xiU8GxMXAoBYBL","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→id: test-rel01.0\n     2→title: \"Test Suite: rel01.0 — wc specification and differential test\"\n     3→release: rel01.0\n     4→\n     5→traces:\n     6→  - rel01.0-uc001-wc\n     7→  - prd005-wc R1\n     8→  - prd005-wc R2\n     9→  - prd005-wc R3\n    10→  - prd005-wc R4\n    11→  - prd005-wc R5\n    12→  - prd005-wc R6\n    13→\n    14→preconditions:\n    15→  - ./bin/wc exists (built via mage build).\n    16→  - Reference binary gwc is installed via Homebrew (coreutils) and on PATH.\n    17→  - Tests are run via go test ./cmd/wc/... which invokes RunDiffTests from pkg/testutils.\n    18→  - All tests use LC_ALL=C to eliminate locale-dependent divergence.\n    19→  - \"wc: no normalization is applied; wc output is deterministic integer counts.\"\n    20→\n    21→test_cases:\n    22→  - name: wc_default_three_lines\n    23→    description: Default flags (line, word, byte count) with three-line stdin.\n    24→    inputs:\n    25→      args: []\n    26→      stdin: \"foo\\nbar baz\\nqux\\n\"\n    27→      env: [\"LC_ALL=C\"]\n    28→    normalization: none\n    29→    expected:\n    30→      exit_code: 0\n    31→      stdout_structure: 'output contains \"3\"'\n    32→      stderr: \"\"\n    33→    traces:\n    34→      - prd005-wc R1.1\n    35→      - prd005-wc R1.2\n    36→      - prd005-wc R1.3\n    37→\n    38→  - name: wc_lines_only\n    39→    description: -l flag counts newline characters only.\n    40→    inputs:\n    41→      args: [\"-l\"]\n    42→      stdin: \"one\\ntwo\\nthree\\n\"\n    43→      env: [\"LC_ALL=C\"]\n    44→    normalization: none\n    45→    expected:\n    46→      exit_code: 0\n    47→      stdout_structure: 'output contains \"3\"'\n    48→      stderr: \"\"\n    49→    traces:\n    50→      - prd005-wc R2.1\n    51→      - prd005-wc R2.6\n    52→\n    53→  - name: wc_words_only\n    54→    descript